Warning cleanup, shared code: spelling only, no behaviour change.

Fixes clang warnings that are cosmetic in this code; every change compiles to the same behaviour.
- -Wnontrivial-memcall (52 occurrences, texture/cache.h is included by 13 files): TextureKey and TextureBinding are
  memcpy'd/memset on purpose so the padding stays zero for a stable hash; the destination is cast to void* as clang
  suggests.
- -Wunused-parameter in widely included headers (texture/cache.h global_lock, xmemory.h host_page_number,
  xma/decoder.h ppc_context): the parameter names are commented out; signatures and vtables are unchanged.
- xenos.h MakePacketType0 ignored its one_reg argument (bit 15 of the type-0 header, which the index mask leaves
  free); it now sets it. The only caller (xboxkrnl_video.cpp) passes the default false, so its packets are unchanged.
- -Wmissing-field-initializers (29, dxbc_translator.cpp system constant table): SystemConstantRdef::padding_after gets
  a default member initializer of 0, the value the omitted initializers already gave it; layout unchanged.
- -Wreorder-ctor: the initializer lists of RenderTargetCache, NullDevice, DxbcShaderTranslator, XObject and Window are
  written in member declaration order, which is the order they were always initialized in; no initializer reads
  another member.
- -Wsign-compare on unsigned `== -1` sentinels (xma_decoder, translator, xam_net, xboxkrnl_debug, xfile, xsocket): the
  -1 is written in the operand's unsigned type, the same value the implicit conversion produced. imgui_drawer casts
  the already non-negative button index to size_t.
- -Wpessimizing-move (presenter.cpp x2) and -Wrange-loop-construct (primitive_processor.cpp): return locals without
  std::move, iterate the map with const auto& (the old declared pair type made a copy of every entry).
- -Wmissing-braces/-Wmissing-field-initializers (xboxkrnl_threading.cpp): X_SLIST_HEADER `= {0}` becomes `= {}`, still
  all zero.
- -Wunused-lambda-capture (utf8.cpp): prime is a constant expression and needs no capture.

